# The app needs no environment variables or secrets (see docs/architecture.md).
# Real values must never be committed; .env* files are git-ignored except this one.
# Optional, for running Playwright against a deployed site instead of a local build:
# E2E_BASE_URL=https://your-deployment.example
# Optional: pin the app clock to an ISO timestamp so delivery estimates are deterministic (the Playwright web server sets it).
# APP_FIXED_NOW=2026-10-01T12:00:00Z
